WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.902 --> 00:00:07.182
<v Owner console>Records management is set here, and every schedule starts switched off.

2
00:00:07.182 --> 00:00:12.989
A schedule needs its authority cited. One without is somebody’s guess.

3
00:00:13.036 --> 00:00:19.493
<v Privacy inventory>Built from the live database every time you open it, so it cannot quietly stop being true.

4
00:00:19.493 --> 00:00:25.166
It reports its own gaps, and exports as Markdown for a privacy assessment.
